      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to escape from the stress of urban life? <strong>Nom Nom: Cozy Forest Café</strong> is a cozy and relaxing decoration and rhythm game where you manage a café and befriend cute animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/c67894c9e6e9031f5f932f03ac420f6f.poster.avif?t=1769533540\" width=960 height=283 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/c67894c9e6e9031f5f932f03ac420f6f.webm?t=1769533540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low stress, non confrontational, relaxing experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Manage your own cafeteria】</strong> Customize your place with furniture, decorations, lamps, wallpaper, and flooring. Take pictures of your favourite corners, dishes, and customers and share them on the café's website.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Adorable customers】 </strong>Forge friendships and learn about their favourite recipes and decorations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/6578d5c33ddb190ecf0d8da74f6effbb.poster.avif?t=1769533540\" width=960 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/6578d5c33ddb190ecf0d8da74f6effbb.webm?t=1769533540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Learn new recipes... To the beat!】</strong> Prepare snacks and drinks, from waffles to sodas, to the rhythm of upbeat tunes and colourful animations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Unleash your creativity!】</strong> Practice your skills whenever you like. Experiment with new ingredient combinations and sell them in your own vending machine to earn rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Use your own custom designs!】</strong> You can customise different objects, as well as your dishes! Paint signs, posters and even T-shirts for your customers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/7b47f32fd21e49900542758190d2a2f6.poster.avif?t=1769533540\" width=960 height=283 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/7b47f32fd21e49900542758190d2a2f6.webm?t=1769533540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>",
