.webm?t=1769533540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Learn new recipes... To the beat!】</strong> Prepare snacks and drinks, from waffles to sodas, to the rhythm of upbeat tunes and colourful animations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Unleash your creativity!】</strong> Practice your skills whenever you like. Experiment with new ingredient combinations and sell them in your own vending machine to earn rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Use your own custom designs!】</strong> You can customise different objects, as well as your dishes! Paint signs, posters and even T-shirts for your customers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/7b47f32fd21e49900542758190d2a2f6.poster.avif?t=1769533540\" width=960 height=283 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428800/extras/7b47f32fd21e49900542758190d2a2f6.webm?t=1769533540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>",
